    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/fcbbf31d6f66c4da3160e5589fb2112c.avif?t=1726694548\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Panzer Party!</h2><br>Ever wondered what tanks do in their free time? Now you know, THEY PARTY.<br><br>Fight your way through various maps against online players in this epic top down physical shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/d5087a108facef2d34d3209258101fce.poster.avif?t=1726694548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/d5087a108facef2d34d3209258101fce.webm?t=1726694548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/d5087a108facef2d34d3209258101fce.mp4?t=1726694548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Top down physics driven shooting<br></li><li>Up to 8 player Steam Direct multiplayer<br></li><li>Various levels and game modes<br></li><li>Tank customization, express yourself with your own unique tank<br></li><li>Levels that adapt according to the music playing</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/fcbbf31d6f66c4da3160e5589fb2112c.avif?t=1726694548\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Panzer Party!</h2><br>Ever wondered what tanks do in their free time? Now you know, THEY PARTY.<br><br>Fight your way through various maps against online players in this epic top down physical shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/d5087a108facef2d34d3209258101fce.poster.avif?t=1726694548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/d5087a108facef2d34d3209258101fce.webm?t=1726694548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347000/extras/d5087a108facef2d34d3209258101fce.mp4?t=1726694548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Top down physics driven shooting<br></li><li>Up to 8 player Steam Direct multiplayer<br></li><li>Various levels and game modes<br></li><li>Tank customization, express yourself with your own unique tank<br></li><li>Levels that adapt according to the music playing</li></ul><br>",
    "short_description": "Panzer Party is an online arena mayhem with tanks! Be careful of bouncing bullets, explosive surprises, shifting levels and much more!",
